### Stack / buffer honesty
| Layer | What happens | Class |
|-------|----------------|-------|
| Last-arg accumulate | `str_slice` once for `[last_start, n)` | **path-A** — no O(arg²) concat |
| Runtime `oo_str_slice` | one alloc + memcpy of the span | O(\|last\|) heap, honest |
| Walk `char_at` | runtime 1-char `OoStr` per visit | O(\|args\|) 1-byte temps — **language floor**, not 7.2 leak |
| C stack `char buf[N]` | not expressible in `.oo` | not required for alpha close |

Complexity: time O(|args|) char visits; aux = O(1) scalars (`i`, `in_str`,
`depth`, `last_start`) + one final slice. No growing concat buffer.

